          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: دیور",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دیور — devar — \"a husband's younger brother\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "میرا دیور کالج میں پڑھتا ہے۔ merā devar kālij meṅ paṛhtā hai. My husband's younger brother is at college."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
